2. Read the relevant `.ai/` context files.
3. Inspect the existing code and architecture.
4. Check the current Git status.
5. Understand existing implementation before proposing replacements or major refactoring.

Never assume that previous chat history is available.

## During Work

Keep the project context synchronized with the actual repository.

When you discover important information, update the appropriate context file.

